  ("CHESS-LISP-ZERO-SELF-PLAY-REPLAY-VERIFY" . (
    (priority . 6.0)
    (done . t)
    (capabilities . (chess my-lisp wsm testing evidence))
    (depends-on . (CHESS-LISP-ZERO-POLICY-PLANE-CONTRACT CHESS-LISP-ZERO-MYLISP-PUCT-MCTS))
    (origin . chess-lisp-zero)
    (description . "Add a pure-WSM export/replay pin for the self-play record contract: freeze a committed fixture (FEN, side, PUCT-indexed sparse policy, outcome, derived 1152-plane vector) and, in pure WSM, re-parse the FEN, re-derive planes bit-exactly, re-index the policy against the legal-move vocabulary, and assert round-trip stability. No PyTorch, no training/ edits, no GPU; torch/CML consumers can assert against the same fixture. WSM stays the single semantic authority; defined 2026-08-29 by vyasa to stay non-overlapping with the torch from-zero backend. STATUS: completed 2026-08-29 by vyasa -- SHA f71d3ab (pushed): tests/replay-verify.wsm 9/9 PASS + SELF-PLAY-REPLAY-VERIFY-PASS, fixture tests/fixtures/self-play-replay-fix.my, driver docs/SELF-PLAY-REPLAY-VERIFY.md.")))
